   "subject": "INLA weights",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>I have a variable for which each observation has an associated standard deviation. I would like to run a logistic regression with this variable as a predictor.</div><div>I was wandering if I can use the weights option <span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:11pt\">weight\n=precision=1/(sd**2) in order to incorporate the uncertainty about this covariate. So my weights would be a variable in the dataset defining the precision about the predictor.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:11pt\">Thank you,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:11pt\">Georgiana    </span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "U5N0hK09w3EJ",
   "from": "INLA help",
   "author": "3eab71733027a24a",
   "date": "2012-08-20T16:54:33Z",
   "subject": "Re: [r-inla] INLA weights",
   "parts": [
    [
     3,
     "On Mon, 2012-08-20 at 06:39 -0700, georgianao wrote:\r<br>&gt; I have a variable for which each observation has an associated\r<br>&gt; standard deviation. I would like to run a logistic regression with\r<br>&gt; this variable as a predictor.\r<br>&gt; I was wandering if I can use the weights option weight\r<br>&gt; =precision=1/(sd**2) in order to incorporate the uncertainty about\r<br>&gt; this covariate. So my weights would be a variable in the dataset\r<br>&gt; defining the precision about the predictor.\r<br>&gt; Thank you,\r<br>&gt; Georgiana    \r<br>\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "you can, look at model &#39;me&#39; here\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/a/r-inla.org/www/models/latent-models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/a/r-inla.org/www/models/latent-models&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447257405000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MBqH-qOGKE0RG4gGjIv-V\">https://sites.google.com/a/r-inla.org/www/models/latent-models</a>\r<br>\r<br>and option &#39;scale&#39; (inside the f()). also set the hyperparameters to\r<br>fit your problem. \r<br>\r<br>note that this model is currently in development (marked as\r<br>&#39;experimental&#39; and you&#39;ll get a warning using it), and new extentions\r<br>of it will appear soon. Please contact Andrea Riebler in Zurich for\r<br>details. \r<br>\r<br>\r<br>-- \r<br>INLA help &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">he...@r-inla.org</a>&gt;\r<br>R-INLA\r<br>\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2QeN99XtdOoJ",
   "from": "georgianao",
   "author": "281cea27474de3f0",
   "date": "2012-08-21T17:08:59Z",
   "subject": "Re: INLA weights",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">I got an error when I used the\nscale parameter in the example model, I tried to use scale =1 and also scale=scalevar (a variable).</span></font></font></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">When I use scale=1 I got the following error:</span></font></font></div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u> <u></u></span><u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Error: length(random.spec$values.order)\n== ns is not TRUE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">When I used scale= scalevar (a\nvariable) INLA stopped working.<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Below is the model (the original\nexample with the scale added):<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">n = 100<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec.y = 100<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec.obs = 10<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec.x = 1<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">scalevar=rnorm(n,0,1)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">## true unobserved covariate<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">x = rnorm(n, sd = 1/sqrt(prec.x))<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">## the observed covariate<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">xobs = x + rnorm(n, sd =\n1/sqrt(prec.obs))<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">## regression model using the\nunobserved &#39;x&#39;<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">y = 1 + 4*x + rnorm(n, sd =\n1/sqrt(prec.y))<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">## prior parameters<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prior.prec = c(1, 0.01)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prior.beta = c(0, 0.1)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">formula = y ~ 1 +<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">f(xobs, model=&quot;me&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">hyper = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">beta = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">param = prior.beta,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">fixed = FALSE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec.obs = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">param = prior.prec,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">initial = log(prec.obs),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">fixed = TRUE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec.x = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">param = prior.prec,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">initial = log(prec.x),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">fixed = FALSE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">mean.x = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">initial = 0,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">fixed=TRUE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">scale=1<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">r = inla(formula,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">data = data.frame(y, xobs),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">family = &quot;gaussian&quot;,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">control.family = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">hyper = list(<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">prec = list(param = prior.prec,<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">initial = log(prec.y),<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">fixed=FALSE<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">summary(r)<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></font></p><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n<u></u><u></u></font></font></font>"
    ]
   ]
